* ------------------------------------------------------------------
* Example Pin Definition File for QSymGen2
*
* Implements: Microchip PIC18F4455/PIC18F4550 40-pindevices
* Author:     Robert Dunn
* Revised:    2026.05.20
* Datasheet:  https://ww1.microchip.com/downloads/en/devicedoc/39632e.pdf
*
* Note:  Untested, from datasheet and pinout diagrams.  Please verify and report any errors.
*
* Note: OSCn pins are defined as input pins.  I don't think the simulator supports them....
* 
* Note: Power pins (VDD, VSS, VUSB) are defined as input pins.  Simulator support for
* VDD has had bugs.  Uncertain about VUSB....
* ------------------------------------------------------------------
*
D Microchip PIC18F4455/PIC18F4550
*
P PIC18F4455 PIC18F4550
*
* Pin Definitions
*
I VDD
I VSS
I VUSB
X
I OSC1 CLKI
X
B RA0 AN0
B RA1 AN1
B RA2 AN2/VREF-/CVREF
B RA3 AN3/VREF+
B RA4 T0CKI/C1OUT/RCV
B RA5 AN4/SS/HLVDIN/C2OUT
B RA6 OSC2/CLKO
X
B RB0 AN12/INT0/FLT0/SDI/SDA
B RB1 AN10/INT1/SCK/SCL
B RB2 AN8/INT2/VMO
B RB3 AN9/CCP2/VPO
B RB4 AN11/KBI0/CSSPP
B RB5 KBI1/PGM
B RB6 KBI2/PGC
B RB7 KBI3/PGD
X
B RC0 T1OSO/T13CKI
B RC1 T1OSI/CCP2/UOE
B RC2 CCP1/P1A
B RC4 D-/VM
B RC5 D+/VP
B RC6 TX/CK
B RC7 RX/DT/SDO
X
B RD0 SPP0
B RD1 SPP1
B RD2 SPP2
B RD3 SPP3
B RD4 SPP4
B RD5 SPP5/P1B
B RD6 SPP6/P1C
B RD7 SPP7/P1D
X
B RE0 AN5/CK1SPP
B RE1 AN6/CK2SPP
B RE2 AN7/OESPP
I RE3 MCLR/VPP
X
I CLK [Not A Device Pin]
